        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ralek Gracie, Rorion Gracie, Rickson Gracie, Royce Gracie, Josh Barnett\n- Organizations: Legends of MMA Hall of Fame, UFC Hall of Fame\n- Promotions: Metamoris, UFC\n- Places: Los Angeles, California\n- Concepts: Gracie family, Gracie Jiu-Jitsu\n\nFacts:\n- Rickson Gracie was born on November 21, 1958.\n- Rickson Gracie is a Brazilian 9th degree red belt in Gracie Jiu-Jitsu and a retired mixed martial artist.\n- Ralek Gracie is the son of Rorion Gracie and a member of the Gracie family.\n- Ralek Gracie is the nephew of Rickson Gracie and Royce Gracie.\n- Rickson Gracie is a Legends of MMA Hall of Famer.\n- Royce Gracie is a UFC Hall of Famer.\n- Metamoris is a Brazilian jiu-jitsu promotion founded by Ralek Gracie.\n- Metamoris organizes events in Los Angeles, California.\n- Josh Barnett is a former UFC Heavyweight Champion.\n- Josh Barnett is the inaugural and current Metamoris Heavyweight Champion.",
